  "description": "Rooster Saga is a fast-paced arcade game built around timing, reflexes, and precision.\n\nTap to keep the rooster airborne, dodge endless obstacles, and survive for as long as possible. Each mistake costs one of your limited lives.\n\nDesigned for quick play sessions and constant retries, the game features simple controls with a tough challenge. There are no upgrades or shortcuts — success depends entirely on skill and focus.\n\nCompete on global all-time leaderboards or take on weekly challenges to compare your scores with players around the world.\n\nChase records and see how far you can go.",
